msgstr "Sculptools: Layers 在此物体上未找到图层。"

#: layers_base.py:1428
msgid "Sculptools: Layers found the Multires out of sync: use 'Sync Multires' in the panel."
msgstr "Sculptools: Layers 发现多级精度不同步：请使用面板中的“同步多级精度”。"

#: layers_base.py:1014
#: layers_base.py:3411
