msgstr "Sculptools: Layers 没有可烘焙的可见图层。"

#: layers_base.py:1418
msgid "Sculptools: Layers has nothing to erase: the active layer's opacity is 0."
msgstr "Sculptools: Layers 没有可擦除的内容：活动图层的不透明度为 0。"

#: layers_base.py:1490
msgid "Sculptools: Layers lost the Morph source object; nothing applied."
msgstr "Sculptools: Layers 丢失了 Morph 源物体；未应用任何内容。"

#: layers_base.py:1503
msgid "Sculptools: Layers lost the active layer; nothing applied."
msgstr "Sculptools: Layers 丢失了活动图层；未应用任何内容。"

#: layers_base.py:3080
msgid "Sculptools: Layers needs a Multires modifier on the object."
msgstr "Sculptools: Layers 需要物体上有多级精度修改器。"

#: layers_base.py:3089
msgid "Sculptools: Layers needs at least 1 Multires subdivision."
msgstr "Sculptools: Layers 至少需要 1 级多级精度细分。"

#: layers_base.py:1413
#: layers_base.py:2173
msgid "Sculptools: Layers needs the active layer visible."
msgstr "Sculptools: Layers 需要活动图层可见。"

#: layers_base.py:1697
msgid "Sculptools: Layers restored the Multires viewport display; the layer data already matches the grid."
msgstr "Sculptools: Layers 已恢复多级精度视图显示；图层数据已与网格匹配。"

#: layers_base.py:1400
msgid "Sculptools: Layers runs the Morph Brush in Sculpt Mode only."
msgstr "Sculptools: Layers 仅在雕刻模式下运行 Morph 笔刷。"

#: layers_base.py:1439
msgid "Sculptools: Layers started the Morph Brush: paint to erase the active layer, Ctrl restores it."
msgstr "Sculptools: Layers 已启动 Morph 笔刷：绘制以擦除活动图层，Ctrl 可恢复。"

#: layers_base.py:2708
msgid "Sculptools: Layers unlinked the layer data."
msgstr "Sculptools: Layers 已取消链接图层数据。"

#: layers_base.py:829
msgid "Sculptools: Layers works on the Basis shape key only: make Basis the active shape key and try again."
msgstr "Sculptools: Layers 仅适用于 Basis 形态键：请将 Basis 设为活动形态键后重试。"

